{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53166","headline":"送最澄上人还日本国 · 毛涣","name":"送最澄上人还日本国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里求文教，王春怆别离。\n未（日本甲本注：「未，应作来。\n」）传不住相，归集祖行诗。\n举笔论蕃意，焚香问汉仪。\n莫言沧海濶，杯度自应知。\n（同前）（按：此诗原署「台州临县令毛涣」，台州有临海县，无临县，「临县」应即指临海县，「临」下脱去「海」字。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛涣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}